# Bump the version on every change

Every change to this project increments the patch version before the work is finished. `0.1.1` becomes `0.1.2`. Do this once per user request, including docs-only and script-only edits.

Update all of these to the same version:

- `bridgething/config.yaml` `version`
- `bridgething/custom_components/bridgething/manifest.json` `version`
- `bridgething/api/version.py` `__version__`

The gateway announce reads `__version__` for `appVersion` and `adapterVersion`. Leave `libVersion` and `libbridgethingVersion` alone; those name the Bridgething library, not this app.
